The code that caused this warning is on line %(line_number)s of the file %(filename)s. To get rid of this warning, pass the additional argument &apos;features=&quot;%(parser)s&quot;&apos; to the <ref refid="classbs4_1_1BeautifulSoup" kindref="compound">BeautifulSoup</ref> constructor.
&quot;&quot;&quot;</initializer>
